 "_note": "Rounds are numbered by the generator that produced them. round5_cues judged the 13 shipped cues; round5_variants judged 104 generated variants, and out/sound-vary/specs-r5.json records what every one of them was. A round whose specs are not written down cannot be analysed once the generator changes, which is how round 3 became unmeasurable.",
